{"4153850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TiefenWolf", "steam_appid": 4153850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiefenwolf is a cooperative submarine simulator centered on a World War II Type VIIC U-boat, recreated with deep attention to historical detail and technical accuracy. The submarine is modeled down to the smallest elements from compartments and equipment to authentic operating procedures and combat decision-making. Every player is a full member of the crew. The captain issues orders, the navigator plots the course, the engineer monitors the systems, and the radio operator listens to sonar. Mission success depends on reaction speed, discipline, communication, and calm decision-making under pressure. The submarine demands constant attention: equipment wears down, systems fail, combat damage, system outages, and flooding of individual compartments all of which the crew must contain and control at any cost. The world around you is constantly changing. Dynamic weather, waves, fog, and lighting directly affect navigation, enemy detection, and the outcome of engagements. This is not an arcade game. It’s a tense, slow, and unforgiving simulator where a single mistake can cost the crew their lives and the right decision can change the outcome of an entire operation. Seal the hatches. Dive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiefenwolf is a cooperative submarine simulator centered on a World War II Type VIIC U-boat, recreated with deep attention to historical detail and technical accuracy. The submarine is modeled down to the smallest elements from compartments and equipment to authentic operating procedures and combat decision-making. Every player is a full member of the crew. The captain issues orders, the navigator plots the course, the engineer monitors the systems, and the radio operator listens to sonar. Mission success depends on reaction speed, discipline, communication, and calm decision-making under pressure. The submarine demands constant attention: equipment wears down, systems fail, combat damage, system outages, and flooding of individual compartments all of which the crew must contain and control at any cost. The world around you is constantly changing. Dynamic weather, waves, fog, and lighting directly affect navigation, enemy detection, and the outcome of engagements. This is not an arcade game. It’s a tense, slow, and unforgiving simulator where a single mistake can cost the crew their lives and the right decision can change the outcome of an entire operation. Seal the hatches. Dive.</p>", "short_description": "Command a meticulously recreated World War II Type VIIC submarine together with your friends. Hunt enemy convoys, maintain and repair your boat, and fight for survival. Success depends on coordination and teamwork only a well-organized crew will be able to complete combat missions.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153850/aab62fc363c6d3ec1f358be9164918dd92926e15/header.jpg?t=1772095559", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153850/3cd97e977d824260d441a12c53433313649201c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772095559", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153850/3cd97e977d824260d441a12c53433313649201c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772095559", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ORYMA GAMES"], "publishers": ["ORYMA GAMES"], "package_groups":